              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_9zVWKk": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We offer two different types of lenses within our prescription program:</p><p><strong>Everyday Clarity:</strong> these lenses are made from CR39 lenses. CR39 is a standard, lightweight plastic material widely used for eyeglasses. It offers exceptional optical clarity with very low color distortion. Our Everyday Clarity lenses are available with OTIS Premium AR Coatings (anti-reflective, hydrophobic, oleophobic) and Blue Light.<br/><br/><strong>Active Protection:</strong> these lenses are made with PC (polycarbonate), which provides exceptional impact resistance, built-in UV protection and a thinner, lighter profile. PC blocks 100% of UV rays inherently without extra coatings. Our Active Protection lenses are available with OTIS Premium AR Coatings (anti-reflective, hydrophobic, oleophobic) and Blue Light.</p><p>Remember, lenses can never be scratch proof hence is not covered under warranty. However, the scratch-resistant coating does reduce the risk of the lenses getting scratched through daily wear and tear.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
